			description: ["Marnie: \"Green planks want heat and time. Josie dried every board in this valley in a furnace and was insufferable about it.\"", "", "Smelt the 32 Green Oak Planks in any furnace — about two minutes for the lot — and hold 32 Seasoned Oak Boards. Marnie's charcoal is in the barrel by the door.", "", "Bram cannot build a Water Wheel until these dry, and the furnace is you. Also the inn's crockery, your chair by the oven, the kitchen kit."]
